# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# VIBIFY ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your project values.
# See DEPLOYMENT.md for detailed setup instructions.

# ─── Supabase (Client-side) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://supabase.com → Project → Settings → API
# NOTE: VITE_ prefix means these are bundled into client-side JavaScript

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ─── Google OAuth (Optional) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# In Supabase Dashboard → Auth → Providers → Google:
#   1. Enable Google provider
#   2. Add your Google OAuth Client ID + Secret (from console.cloud.google.com)
#   3. Add redirect URL: https://your-project-ref.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#
# In your Google Cloud Console → Authorized redirect URIs, add:
#   https://your-project-ref.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#   http://localhost:5173  (for local dev)

# ─── Phone / SMS OTP (Optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# In Supabase Dashboard → Auth → Providers → Phone:
#   Enable Phone provider and connect your Twilio / MessageBird / Vonage account.
#   For dev/testing you can use Supabase's built-in test OTPs.

# ─── Jamendo API (Server-side) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://devportal.jamendo.com/signup
# IMPORTANT: NO VITE_ prefix! These are server-side only secrets.
# Used by /api/jamendo proxy in both dev (Vite) and production (Vercel).
# In production, add these to Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables.

JAMENDO_CLIENT_ID=your-jamendo-client-id
JAMENDO_CLIENT_SECRET=your-jamendo-client-secret

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST (for Vercel)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# [ ] Add all variables above to Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables
# [ ] Ensure JAMENDO_* variables are WITHOUT VITE_ prefix in Vercel
# [ ] Test API endpoints: /api/jamendo, /api/jiosaavn
# [ ] Enable Supabase Realtime for 'rooms' table
# [ ] Verify CORS headers in all API routes
